 (notes
  "ACCEPT AT THE SINGLE-SURFACE LEVEL - NOT a promotion (experiment-flag-discipline.md R3; promotion-confirmation.md grid still owed). calmar for the arm cells not extracted (0.0000 = not read). WHAT THE DATA SAYS: realised +$2.59M / +$1.97M / +$2.48M (3 of 3); maxDD 37.6->30.0 / 32.8->28.1 / 43.0->33.0 (3 of 3); Sharpe better at every salt; level band 627-752% vs 312-640% (salt 2's level is the null's $3.84M open MTM on ADTN/MU/URI - quote bands). Pre-registered rule clears on both criteria at every salt. MECHANISM (salt-robust): the exit mix moves stop_loss 450-481 -> 313-336 and laggard_rotation 236-244 -> 481-493 per cell, and the symbol|entry_date join shows the SHARED trades running wider (+$0.61M / +$1.98M / +$1.65M) - at salt 1 the arm-only and null-only sets net to zero and the whole gain is the shared term. The arm-only monsters recur by name (NOVT 2016-06, KTOS 2025-05, BBWI 2020-08-20, KLIC 2020-11 at 2-3 salts) but are not needed for the verdict. The maxDD win is NOT the item-3 map's twin-double-funding artifact: V6 = 0 on every null cell and the single arm violation is a -$2.8k 4-day pair. COSTS: +125-141 trades per cell; 5-6 force liquidations vs 2-3 and delisted exits 8-10 vs 5-7 (wide arms hold delisted names longer, #2672 family); 7-9 open names at the end vs 3-5 (MTM-heavier upper draws). BEFORE ANY PROMOTION PR: (1) confirmation grid >= 3 independent BROAD cells - 2009 and 2019 _v10dedup vintages at 3 salts each, paired against their own record-convention nulls, plus this 26y cell as the bear-regime cell; (2) dissect the 5-6 force liquidations per cell (phantom pre-#2695 classes vs real gaps); (3) two knobs change (initial_stop_buffer 1.0 -> 0.9167, stop_update_cadence Daily -> Weekly): config-default-blast-radius paired goldens for BOTH, and the book citation - 12% is outside the s5.3 4-6% band and must be argued as a modern-regime adaptation of a dial (weinstein-faithful-core.md W2), weekly re-evaluation is L3 (book-faithful). FORWARD GUIDANCE: this is the first exit-side lever to survive the fixed basis + deduped warehouse + V6 gate at 3 of 3 salts on both criteria; it is a tail-PRESERVING lever (let the same trades run), consistent with project_edge_is_the_fat_tail, and the opposite shape of the same-day admission gate (2026-09-13-deteriorating-breadth-long-gate, REJECT). Artifacts: dev/experiments/cadence-12w-v10-2026-09-13/results/a4-cadence-12w-s{0,1,2}-v10-* paired against stop-width-by-state-2026-09-08/results/a0-breadth-on-null-s{0,1,2}-v10-*. Related ledger: 2026-08-24-stops-basis-book-faithful (the 4% default), 2026-09-09-stop-width-by-macro-state-surface (per-state width: REJECT-as-default)."))
